OL,3,GNEWSAVictorious disabled club to
OL,4,Aattract more cricketers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disability cricket club, which has
OL,7,Fbeen crowned national champions, said
OL,8,Fit aimed to build on the success and
OL,9,Fwelcome more players.
OL,11,FSomerset Disabled Cricket Club (SDCC)
OL,12,Fwon the D40 Pursuit National
OL,13,FChampionship after beating Middlesex in
OL,14,Fthe final at Corsham Cricket Club,
OL,15,FWiltshire, on 30 August.
OL,17,FCaptain Nick Dean, 31, who has familial
OL,18,Fspastic diplegia affecting movement in
OL,19,Fhis legs, said playing in the inclusive
OL,20,Fenvironment of the club had "changed
OL,21,Fhis life".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
