OL,3,GNEWSAVictorious disabled club to
OL,4,Aattract more cricketers
OL,5,
OL,6,FSDCC will celebrate the win at an end
OL,7,Fof season party at the Somerset County
OL,8,FGround in October and spend the winter
OL,9,F"growing and getting better".
